        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nthu aluan lauphun suan rui kapuan karuna,",
            "Zeliangrong kandi ta nangniu rui ti-gaanlou",
            "",
            "Aniu lung kaluanthau na,",
            "Khrista ta thuan kho;",
            "Nkhuang baza kazauhna",
            "Kata thuanku kho,",
            "Adih nthuk kan tucho?",
            "Raguang ramdam hei.",
            "",
            "2. Duipi duiba neihpat neihkei ramphaan zau puki,",
            "Akandimei guai zipri bammei ta hou e.",
            "",
            "3. Kandi khou puanpiu suna gaimei munpuang guai rui,",
            "Thautho thautho tuna nchiang bam the ‘niu ta.",
            "",
            "4. Ahuh, Alangh duipui rui na luangbam saan khou hei",
            "Zeliangrong kandi hei khatsini kachan lak."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
